## 🗑️ Clearing All Data

### **Clear User Data (Frontend)**

```javascript
await SearchTrackerAPI.clearUserData();
```

### **Clear KV Namespace (Backend)**

```bash
# ⚠️ DANGER: This deletes ALL data!
wrangler kv:key list --binding=SEARCH_DATA | \
  jq -r '.[].name' | \
  xargs -I {} wrangler kv:key delete {} --binding=SEARCH_DATA
```

